  "body": "If you are after un-interrupted north facing views, This is the property for you.\r\n\r\nPerched proudly on a rare 1,033 sqm freehold corner site, 8 Discovery Drive combines classic craftsmanship with spectacular, un-buildable 180-degree views across Fairway Bay. Built to an uncompromising standard by its original owners, this sun-drenched 218 sqm single-level residence offers an unbeatable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n* Architectural Craftsmanship & Comfort - Constructed with timeless schist brick pillars, weatherboard, cedar, and a solid concrete tile roof-craftsmanship that is increasingly uneconomic to replicate today.\r\n* 4 Double Bedrooms: Includes a spacious master suite and a private bedroom wing supported by a guest powder room.\r\n* Dual Living Spaces: Features expansive open-plan living alongside a separate formal lounge for quiet relaxation or entertaining guests.\r\n* Chef's Kitchen: Beautifully appointed with a dedicated scullery for effortless meal prep.\r\nModern Upgrades: Includes a double internal-access garage, vast attic storage, and EV-ready charging infrastructure.\r\n* Year-Round Entertaining: Wide-open dining and living spaces flow out to an extensive deck equipped with an all-weather Louvretec roof system, framing golden sunset vistas.\r\n* Sprawling Sanctuary: Established grounds with mature fruit trees provide endless space and privacy rarely found in the area.\r\n* Exclusive Resort Privileges: Enjoy private membership access to the Fairway Bay Owners Association-including a heated pool, tennis court, and clubhouse-located just 90 metres from your front door.\r\n\r\nPriced on the button at $1,365,000 and if you are the new owner, you will insure this home for considerably more than what you purchase it for.\r\n\r\nContact Emma Miller today on 021 392 262 or Roger Sumich on 029 666 66 66 to arrange your private viewing or come along to one of our listed open homes.\r\n\r\nThis Sunday 2.00 - 2.30",
